Functions of Components:
Flight controller - It is the brain of the drone. It controls all drone movements.
ESC (Electronic Speed Controller) - It controls the speed of each motor.
Brushless Motors - They rotate the propellers tto produce lift.
Propellers - They generate lift and thrust to make the drone fly.
Battery (Li-Po) - It supplies power to all drone components.
Power Distribution Board (PDB) - It distributes power from the battery to different parts.
GPS Module - It gives the drone its location and helps in navigation.
Radio Receiver - It receives signals from the remote controller.
Frame - It is the body of the drone that holds all components together.
   10. Telemetry Module - It sends drone data (battery, speed, location, height) to the ground station.
